error[L0246]: a `rust` with clauses takes a type parameter
 --> expand/rust_clause_errors.knv:3:5
  |
3 |     (fn (i64) i64)
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this type binds no type parameter
  |
  = help: bind a parameter for the clauses to choose by, as in `(where ((s source)) (fn ((ref s)) string))`
  = note: run `knave doc L0246` for an explanation

